NOTICE — uika (0.1.0 preview)

1. No personal data. This repository ships no personal paths, registries,
   archives, telemetry, or credentials. Estate instances live outside the
   tool; point UIKA_ESTATE_HOME (or --root) at your own estate directory.
   Every file under examples/ is synthetic and written for this release.

2. Keys by reference. Configuration carries environment-variable *names*
   only (keyEnv / secretEnv). Secret values never belong in any file this
   tool reads or writes. See skills/mcp-and-keys and docs/manual.md.

3. Skills. skills/ contains estate-authored skills in the Agent Skills
   format (one folder with SKILL.md each). Third-party skills are NOT
   vendored here; pin your own copies if you need them.

4. Lineage. The law-block format, session protocol, and harness-matrix
   knowledge in this release were distilled from a private personal estate
   tool of the same name; the private instance remains private. Source
   comments cite decision records as "ADR-00NN"; those records belong to
   the private estate and are not published with this package.

5. Status. This is the 0.1.0 preview: the bundled modules are the real,
   tested implementation; docs and schema are new writing. See
   CHANGELOG.md for release notes and known limitations.
